>> title: Overnight Oats
>> course: breakfast
>> servings: 1
>> source: Studio Cooking wiki

Stir @rolled oats{60%g} into @milk{150%ml} and @yoghurt{80%g} in a #jar{}.

Add @chia seeds{1%tbsp} and a pinch of @salt, lid it, and leave it in the fridge overnight.

Top with @berries{1%handful} in the morning.
